    Notification[flowcloud-notification<br/>消息 / 模板]
    Report[flowcloud-report<br/>工作台 / 分析]
    MySQL[(MySQL)]
    Redis[(Redis)]
    MQ[(RabbitMQ / Kafka)]
    MinIO[(MinIO)]

    Web -->|HTTP / JWT / API Crypto| Admin
    Admin --> System
    Admin --> Approval
